{"abstract":[{"text":"The part-group element indicates groupings of parts in the score, usually indicated by braces and brackets.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Braces that are used for multi-staff parts should be defined in the attributes element for that part. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part-group start element appears before the first score-part in the group. The part-group stop element appears","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after the last score-part in the group.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartgroup"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/init(name:nameDisplay:abbreviation:abbreviationDisplay:symbol:barline:stretchesTimeSignature:footnote:level:kind:number:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/abbreviation","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/abbreviationDisplay","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/barline","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/footnote","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/kind","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/level","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/name","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/nameDisplay","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup\/number","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/document